---
/**
 * "En Rukh": where the general idea of a chapter meets the course's own model. One compact box
 * per chapter, the same everywhere, so a reader who only wants the big picture can see it for
 * what it is (the bridge into the lessons) and skim past it. Plain words and numbers that teach
 * something on their own; no internal run names.
 */
---

<aside class="llm-rukh" role="note" aria-label="En Rukh">
  <p class="label llm-rukh__kind">// En Rukh</p>
  <div class="llm-rukh__body">
    <slot />
  </div>
</aside>
